  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- A transverse wave is one where the particles oscillate **perpendicular** to the direction of the\n\n  - Propagation of the wave\n  - Direction of energy transfer\n- Transverse waves show areas of **crests **(peaks) and **troughs**"
  },
